  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and multiprofile data (config_005) achieve the highest accuracy (0.6501). However, adding image modalities (config_030) slightly reduced performance, suggesting uncertainty about image encoder or fusion method effectiveness. This experiment tests using the more advanced imagenet_vit_l image encoder with the same RNA encoder, profile setting, and aggregation as config_005, isolating the impact of image encoder choice. It directly addresses whether better image representations could improve performance without changing multiple factors simultaneously."
